p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/ff442b8228c447bb6328c9a2f8e2f3dd.poster.avif?t=1762810779\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/ff442b8228c447bb6328c9a2f8e2f3dd.webm?t=1762810779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/ff442b8228c447bb6328c9a2f8e2f3dd.mp4?t=1762810779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE TOMES FROM THE TEAR-ABLE TORN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dive deep into the myriad <strong>Tomes</strong>: echoes of familiar tales and fables with unique, run-altering mechanics. Band together with your fellow players to harness thematic, team-wide boons in your fight to preserve these pages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot twist - <strong>The Torn </strong>hunger for pages of their own! Play to your strengths by <strong>choosing how your foes evolve</strong>. Save more books from this dynamic foe, apply higher\u00a0<strong>Binding Challenges</strong>\u00a0to each journey, and overcome even the toughest obstacles to protect the Illuminated Library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/67d89802caa65da829d40dc95b61c884.poster.avif?t=1762810779\" width=768 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/67d89802caa65da829d40dc95b61c884.webm?t=1762810779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/67d89802caa65da829d40dc95b61c884.mp4?t=1762810779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOME: FREE TO BE YOUR SHELF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Home, sweet home! Rest and regroup in <strong>The Illuminated Library</strong> between adventures. Refine your strengths by researching and enhancing the power of your Ink! There's always a cozy place\u00a0to read - especially when you can <strong>make one</strong> yourself! Explore the Library's secrets, then relax in your personal <strong>Customizable Reading Nook</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/6658d0e670b4102d86f7ff231052603c.poster.avif?t=1762810779\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/6658d0e670b4102d86f7ff231052603c.webm?t=1762810779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/6658d0e670b4102d86f7ff231052603c.mp4?t=1762810779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RAID BETWEEN THE LINES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deeper evil lies in store,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beyond the page and secret door,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A broken realm where magic fades</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beware the dreaded <strong>Torn Lord Raids...</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/extras/c5ef6e9d956c69aaac45025e6d464886.webp?t=1762810779\" width=700 height=44 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Table of Contents:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swift Tales</strong>: Approachable, under 30-minute roguelike runs crafted for quick gameplay sessions for 1-4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature Inks</strong>: Infuse your spells with one of\u00a0<i>6 colorful classes</i>, complete with their own unique upgrades and rewarding challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolls of Power</strong>: Tear through enemies with over 300 powers for you and your team. All powers can be build-makers, no filler.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shaping Your Spellbook</strong>: Wield and combine an imaginative roster of over 20 spells - conjure Sewing Needles, hurl Anchors, sling Playing Cards - then enhance them with limit-breaking augments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torn Pages</strong>: With over 100 enemy upgrades and effects to choose from, only you will decide how your foes evolve throughout the course of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personal Reading Nooks</strong>: Show off your style with hundreds of decorations in your customizable corner of the Library!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Font</strong>: Invoke unique\u00a0<strong>Tome</strong>-themed powers as a team in combination with your individual builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talented Research</strong>: Enhance the magic of ink between runs to improve your Scribe with customizable talents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Bindings</strong>: Increase your challenge by affixing bindings to your runs. Greater danger brings greater rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotating Book Club</strong>: Join other Scribes in tackling fresh, global challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Raid Realms: </strong>Face the Splice Lord in The Forgery and confront the Raving Lord in The Grey Area!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reference Section</strong>: All the high quality literature puns you could ever desire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Appendices</strong>: Reached the end? Found the perfect build? Face the Appendices and continue the fight!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alvios Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917950/09e12018fa1e6883cff59aab4aa40e43bfcc2178/header.jpg?t=1762810779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/917950/882883/eacf51b14cfcefc4f8312bd5619ebdb7a26748af/1750595965/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746189154","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/917950/882883/eacf51b14cfcefc4f8312bd5619ebdb7a26748af/1750595965/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746189154","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/917950/882883/eacf51b14cfcefc4f8312bd5619ebdb7a26748af/1750595965/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746189154","id":257134093,"name":"1.0 Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134093/4634e7f14090ff7e940270740f48cf9f66d6d7f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746189154"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/917950/820879/5e66c2b1d6a2440a371d545810ed8866c39854d7/1750595956/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738285534","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/917950/820879/5e66c2b1d6a2440a371d545810ed8866